                                                "sense_id": "99a349e8-300a-3ba4-8fd9-d30d6c8a0e96",
                                                "text": "We, Greville, are happy in these parks and forests: we were happy in my close winter-walk of box and laurustinus and mezereon. In our earlier days did we not emboss our bosoms with the crocusses, and shake them almost unto shedding with our transports!"
                                            }
                                        ]
